{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19982","headline":"题从叔述灵岩山壁 · 孟郊","name":"题从叔述灵岩山壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"换却世上心，独起山中情。\n露衣凉且鲜，云策高复轻。\n喜见夏日来，变爲松景清。\n每将逍遥听，不厌飕飗声。\n远念尘末宗，未疎俗间名。\n桂枝妄举手，萍路空劳生。\n仰谢开净弦，相招时一鸣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19982.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19982","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}